We are in a terrible position, Sergeant. Commander Harris and most of the rest of our troops are trapped on Elysium - if we don't get a working portal to let them through, they will die out there, millions of light years from home. The engineering team are working on it, but Chinese attacks are too frequent for them to continue without protection. They have put together a shield to protect them from the worst incoming fire, but it will not last long under current conditions. We need you and your men to ward off the Chinese attacks long enough for the engineering team to open a link to Elysium and let the rest of the troops through.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Ward off the Chinese long enough to get our troops back from Elysium.
- Set up a base once they arrive, and drive the Chinese back.